{"output":"I’ll inspect the authorization and cache paths, fix the isolation bugs, and run the existing tests without changing them or installing dependencies.\n\nProject detail reads lack an ownership check, list cache keys omit the organization, and updates never invalidate lists. I’ll add the membership check and an unambiguous organization cache prefix, then test cross-organization access, cache hits after revocation, and invalidation of all list variants.\n\nFixed owning-organization authorization for project reads and updates. Cache keys now isolate organizations and preserve all list options. Updates invalidate every affected organization variant without evicting unrelated lists. Cache-hit authorization remains enforced.\n\nAdded regression tests; existing tests unchanged. No dependencies installed.\n\nnpm test: 11 passed, exit 0.\ngit diff --check: passed, exit 0.\n\nNo blockers.","final_output":"Fixed owning-organization authorization for project reads and updates. Cache keys now isolate organizations and preserve all list options. Updates invalidate every affected organization variant without evicting unrelated lists. Cache-hit authorization remains enforced.\n\nAdded regression tests; existing tests unchanged. No dependencies installed.\n\nnpm test: 11 passed, exit 0.\ngit diff --check: passed, exit 0.\n\nNo blockers.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":10,"tool_calls":[{"name":"skill","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"pwd; git status --short; ls -a; find . -name AGENTS.md -not -path './node_modules/*' -not -path './.git/*'","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-batching-025sltl2/tenant-cache-3-optimized/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":185,"stdout_bytes":134,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-14f7a3773a485fc74ce154100ebda272.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"glob_files","status":"s